      "updated": 1795545135234,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Physics -> Quantum Mechanics\nHistory -> Mosteller-Wallace\n            Fedralist paper\nGoverment -> IQSS (quantitative\n                   social science)\nFinance -> Quant finance\nGambling -> Illegal (Kalshi & PolyM)\n            Fermat - Pascal (1650s)\nLife: Statistics is the logic of\n        uncertainity\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Physics -> Quantum Mechanics\nHistory -> Mosteller-Wallace\n            Fedralist paper\nGoverment -> IQSS (quantitative\n                   social science)\nFinance -> Quant finance\nGambling -> Illegal (Kalshi & PolyM)\n            Fermat - Pascal (1650s)\nLife: Statistics is the logic of\n        uncertainity\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
